{
  "name": "PAD Lower Extremity Revascularization with Lipid-Management Trajectory",
  "remarks": [
    "Models peripheral arterial disease (PAD) patients undergoing OPEN or ENDOVASCULAR",
    "lower extremity revascularization (LER), with preoperative LDL cholesterol and lipid",
    "medications and a one-year post-operative LDL trajectory + lipid-medication escalation.",
    "Data-generation-only module for pad-ler-ldl-synth; consumed by pad-ler-ldl-desc.",
    "",
    "Design intent: preoperative LDL values and lipid-medication use are CONDITIONED on",
    "baseline lipid-associated covariates (not drawn uniformly), and the post-operative",
    "escalation + LDL response is concentrated in the statin-naive / high-LDL / FH strata,",
    "so the LDL trajectory and medication changes are genuinely covariate-associated and",
    "stratifiable by pad-ler-ldl-desc's Strategus characterization.",
    "",
    "Clinical workflow:",
    "  1. PAD onset: age >= 55, Uniform(0,25)y delay, capped at 90.",
    "  2. Outpatient PAD evaluation encounter — during which baseline covariates, preop LDL,",
    "     and preop lipid medications are all recorded.",
    "  3. Baseline lipid-associated covariates (drawn BEFORE LDL/meds so they condition them):",
    "       diabetes 35%, obesity 40%, hypothyroidism 8%, malnutrition 10% (+ serum albumin),",
    "       CKD 15%, current smoker 35%, familial hypercholesterolemia (FH) 4%.",
    "       Sex is intrinsic to every Synthea person (no state needed) and is available to",
    "       the downstream characterization as a demographic covariate.",
    "  4. Preop LDL tier (priority): FH -> very high (185-235); malnutrition -> low (55-92,",
    "       reverse-epidemiology); diabetes/obesity/hypothyroid -> high (135-168); else",
    "       moderate (95-130). A high_risk_group attribute (FH or high tier) drives med rates.",
    "  5. Preop lipid meds conditioned on risk group: statin 82% high-risk vs 52% standard;",
    "       ezetimibe 20% vs 4%; PCSK9i (evolocumab) 30% among FH only. Every statin order",
    "       (preop and postop-new-start) also assigns an INGREDIENT-level intensity: high-",
    "       intensity-capable (atorvastatin) vs low/moderate-intensity-only (simvastatin),",
    "       tracked via the statin_intensity attribute — skewed but not deterministic by risk",
    "       group (85%/15% high-risk, 25%/75% standard preop; 65%/35% for a new postop start,",
    "       reflecting a guideline-directed secondary-prevention indication regardless of",
    "       preop risk tier). Feeds pad-ler-ldl-desc's cohorts 5/6 (statin_high_intensity_",
    "       capable / statin_low_moderate_intensity_only in phenotype_library/catalog.yaml).",
    "  6. Index LER, 50/50: OPEN (inpatient bypass/endarterectomy, rolls up under OMOP",
    "       ancestors 4236706 + 4225375) vs ENDOVASCULAR (outpatient limb revascularization,",
    "       rolls up under 4049825).",
    "  7. First post-op clinic (~30-60d): guideline-directed escalation — statin-naive start",
    "       a statin 75%; already-treated intensify (add ezetimibe) 45%; FH may add PCSK9i.",
    "       Patients who end up on adequate therapy are flagged ldl_controlled_postop.",
    "  8. Quarterly post-op LDL (Q1-Q4 across the year): controlled patients trend to goal;",
    "       uncontrolled (statin-naive, untreated) stay 120-165. At Q4 (the 275-455d window",
    "       pad-ler-ldl-desc's Analysis B reads), controlled patients on a high-intensity-",
    "       capable statin genuinely cross the <55 mg/dL goal (40-58); controlled patients on",
    "       low/moderate-intensity-only therapy improve but usually don't cross it (58-92) —",
    "       this distinction is why cohorts 5/6 exist and is deliberate, not an oversight.",
    "",
    "Cohort definitions:",
    "  Target  : first LER procedure (open OR endovascular), any visit type — see",
    "            study_params.yaml target.index_event.ancestor_concept_ids [4236706,4225375,4049825].",
    "  QC only : first LDL measurement per person (cohorts/outcome_ldl.sql) — a Step-6 signal",
    "            check, NOT the authoritative outcome (that lives in pad-ler-ldl-desc).",
    "",
    "Primary concept codes ([vocab query] against this workspace's omop_vocab, 2026-07-23;",
    "see phenotype_library/catalog.yaml):",
    "  PAD condition                         : SNOMED 399957001 (OMOP 317309 hierarchy)",
    "  OPEN LER (all roll up under 4236706 / 4225375):",
    "    Femoro-popliteal bypass             : SNOMED 112828007 -> OMOP 4012936",
    "    Femoral endarterectomy              : SNOMED 16589005  -> OMOP 4040974",
    "    Aorto-femoral bypass (suprainguinal): SNOMED 405482000 -> OMOP 4231680",
    "    Femoro-tibial bypass                : SNOMED 47575002  -> OMOP 4166196",
    "    Femorofemoral crossover bypass      : SNOMED 233380006 -> OMOP 4049678",
    "  ENDOVASCULAR LER (all roll up under 4049825 Limb revascularization):",
    "    Revascularization of lower limb     : SNOMED 233505002 -> OMOP 4049828",
    "    Revascularization of foot           : SNOMED 233507005 -> OMOP 4050419",
    "    Revascularization of toe            : SNOMED 233508000 -> OMOP 4049829",
    "  LDL cholesterol (calculated)          : LOINC 13457-7 -> OMOP 3028288 (desc of anchor 4012479)",
    "  Serum albumin                         : LOINC 1751-7  -> OMOP 3024561",
    "  Body mass index                       : LOINC 39156-5 -> OMOP 3038553",
    "  Tobacco smoking status                : LOINC 72166-2",
    "  Diabetes mellitus type 2              : SNOMED 44054006",
    "  Obesity                               : SNOMED 414916001 -> OMOP 433736",
    "  Hypothyroidism                        : SNOMED 40930008  -> OMOP 140673",
    "  Nutritional disorder / malnutrition   : SNOMED 2492009   -> OMOP 4090739",
    "  Chronic kidney disease                : SNOMED 709044004 -> OMOP 46271022",
    "  Familial hypercholesterolemia         : SNOMED 398036000 -> OMOP 4134862",
    "  atorvastatin (statin)                 : RxNorm 83367   (ingredient; ancestor of statin_medications set)",
    "  ezetimibe                             : RxNorm 341248  (ingredient; ezetimibe_medications set)",
    "  evolocumab (PCSK9i)                   : RxNorm 1665684 (ingredient; pcsk9_inhibitors set)",
    "",
    "Does NOT model: mortality, limb loss, non-lipid medications, LDL response to specific",
    "drug/dose (escalation is modeled at the controlled/uncontrolled level), or lipid",
    "measurements beyond one post-operative year."
  ],
  "states": {

    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Age_Guard"
    },

    "Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 55,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "PAD_Onset_Delay"
    },

    "PAD_Onset_Delay": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "remarks": ["PAD onset delay: Uniform(0,25) years after age 55 (onset age 55-80)."],
      "range": { "low": 0, "high": 25, "unit": "years" },
      "direct_transition": "Age_90_Check"
    },

    "Age_90_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Cap the PAD pathway at age 90 so procedure ages stay realistic."],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": { "condition_type": "Age", "operator": "<=", "quantity": 90, "unit": "years" },
          "transition": "PAD_Onset"
        },
        { "transition": "Terminal" }
      ]
    },

    "PAD_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "399957001", "display": "Peripheral arterial occlusive disease" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter"
    },

    "PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter": {
      "type": "Encounter",
      "encounter_class": "outpatient",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "185349003", "display": "Encounter for check up" }
      ],
      "remarks": [
        "Initial outpatient PAD evaluation. Baseline covariates, preop LDL, and preop lipid",
        "medications are all documented during this single comprehensive visit."
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Diabetes_Chance"
    },

    "Diabetes_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Type 2 diabetes prevalence in this surgical PAD population modeled at 35%."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.35, "transition": "Diabetes_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.65, "transition": "Obesity_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Diabetes_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "44054006", "display": "Diabetes mellitus type 2" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Metabolic_DM"
    },

    "Set_Metabolic_DM": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "metabolic",
      "value": true,
      "remarks": ["Diabetes raises the baseline LDL tier (metabolic dyslipidemia)."],
      "direct_transition": "Obesity_Chance"
    },

    "Obesity_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Obesity prevalence modeled at 40%."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.40, "transition": "Obesity_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.60, "transition": "BMI_NonObese_Observation" }
      ]
    },

    "Obesity_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "414916001", "display": "Obesity" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Metabolic_Obese"
    },

    "Set_Metabolic_Obese": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "metabolic",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "BMI_Obese_Observation"
    },

    "BMI_Obese_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "vital-signs",
      "unit": "kg/m2",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "39156-5", "display": "Body mass index (BMI) [Ratio]" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 30, "high": 42 },
      "direct_transition": "Hypothyroid_Chance"
    },

    "BMI_NonObese_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "vital-signs",
      "unit": "kg/m2",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "39156-5", "display": "Body mass index (BMI) [Ratio]" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 21, "high": 29.9 },
      "direct_transition": "Hypothyroid_Chance"
    },

    "Hypothyroid_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Hypothyroidism prevalence modeled at 8% — a reversible secondary cause of high LDL."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.08, "transition": "Hypothyroid_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.92, "transition": "Malnutrition_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Hypothyroid_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "40930008", "display": "Hypothyroidism" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Hypothyroid"
    },

    "Set_Hypothyroid": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "hypothyroid",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "Malnutrition_Chance"
    },

    "Malnutrition_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Malnutrition prevalence modeled at 10%. Serum albumin is measured for ALL patients;",
        "malnourished patients get a low value, others a normal value."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.10, "transition": "Malnutrition_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.90, "transition": "Albumin_Normal_Observation" }
      ]
    },

    "Malnutrition_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "2492009", "display": "Nutritional disorder" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Malnourished"
    },

    "Set_Malnourished": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "malnourished",
      "value": true,
      "remarks": ["Malnutrition lowers serum cholesterol/LDL (reverse epidemiology)."],
      "direct_transition": "Albumin_Low_Observation"
    },

    "Albumin_Low_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "g/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "1751-7", "display": "Albumin [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 2.2, "high": 3.3 },
      "direct_transition": "CKD_Chance"
    },

    "Albumin_Normal_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "g/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "1751-7", "display": "Albumin [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 3.6, "high": 4.8 },
      "direct_transition": "CKD_Chance"
    },

    "CKD_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Chronic kidney disease prevalence modeled at 15% (comorbidity covariate)."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "CKD_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.85, "transition": "Smoking_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "CKD_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "709044004", "display": "Chronic kidney disease" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Smoking_Chance"
    },

    "Smoking_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Current smoking prevalence modeled at 35%."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.35, "transition": "Current_Smoker_Observation" },
        { "distribution": 0.65, "transition": "Never_Smoker_Observation" }
      ]
    },

    "Current_Smoker_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "social-history",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "72166-2", "display": "Tobacco smoking status" }
      ],
      "value_code": {
        "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "881661000124108", "display": "Smokes cigarette daily"
      },
      "direct_transition": "FH_Chance"
    },

    "Never_Smoker_Observation": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "social-history",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "72166-2", "display": "Tobacco smoking status" }
      ],
      "value_code": {
        "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "221000119102", "display": "Never smoked any substance"
      },
      "direct_transition": "FH_Chance"
    },

    "FH_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Familial hypercholesterolemia prevalence modeled at 4% — dominant LDL driver."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.04, "transition": "FH_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.96, "transition": "LDL_Tier_Branch" }
      ]
    },

    "FH_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "SNOMED-CT", "code": "398036000", "display": "Familial hypercholesterolemia" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Set_FH"
    },

    "Set_FH": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "fh",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "LDL_Tier_Branch"
    },

    "LDL_Tier_Branch": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Assign the preoperative LDL tier by covariate PRIORITY (first match wins):",
        "  FH            -> very high (genetic, dominates even over malnutrition)",
        "  malnourished  -> low (reverse epidemiology)",
        "  metabolic OR hypothyroid -> high",
        "  else          -> moderate"
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "fh", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_LDL_VeryHigh" },
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "malnourished", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_LDL_Low" },
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "metabolic", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_LDL_High" },
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "hypothyroid", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_LDL_High" },
        { "transition": "Preop_LDL_Moderate" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_LDL_VeryHigh": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "13457-7", "display": "Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma by calculation" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 185, "high": 235 },
      "direct_transition": "Set_HighRisk_True"
    },

    "Preop_LDL_High": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "13457-7", "display": "Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma by calculation" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 135, "high": 168 },
      "direct_transition": "Set_HighRisk_True"
    },

    "Preop_LDL_Moderate": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "13457-7", "display": "Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma by calculation" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 95, "high": 130 },
      "direct_transition": "Set_HighRisk_False"
    },

    "Preop_LDL_Low": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "LOINC", "code": "13457-7", "display": "Cholesterol in LDL [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma by calculation" }
      ],
      "range": { "low": 55, "high": 92 },
      "direct_transition": "Set_HighRisk_False"
    },

    "Set_HighRisk_True": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "high_risk_group",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "Preop_Statin_Decision"
    },

    "Set_HighRisk_False": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "high_risk_group",
      "value": false,
      "direct_transition": "Preop_Statin_Decision"
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Decision": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "high_risk_group", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Chance_High" },
        { "transition": "Preop_Statin_Chance_Std" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Chance_High": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["High-risk (FH or high LDL) preop statin use 82%, mostly high-intensity-capable."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.82, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Intensity_High" },
        { "distribution": 0.18, "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Decision" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Chance_Std": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Standard-risk preop statin use 52%, mostly low/moderate-intensity."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.52, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Intensity_Std" },
        { "distribution": 0.48, "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Decision" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Intensity_High": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["High-risk patients: 85% high-intensity-capable ingredient, 15% low/moderate anyway (real-world intensity choice is not perfectly risk-stratified)."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.85, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Order_HighIntensity" },
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Order_LowModIntensity" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Intensity_Std": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Standard-risk patients: mostly low/moderate-intensity, 25% high-intensity-capable anyway."],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.25, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Order_HighIntensity" },
        { "distribution": 0.75, "transition": "Preop_Statin_Order_LowModIntensity" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Order_HighIntensity": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "statin_rx",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "RxNorm", "code": "83367", "display": "atorvastatin" }
      ],
      "remarks": ["Chronic statin — not ended (continues as long-term lipid therapy). High-intensity-capable ingredient (pad-ler-ldl-desc cohort 5 / statin_high_intensity_capable)."],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Statin_Intensity_High_Preop"
    },

    "Set_Statin_Intensity_High_Preop": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "statin_intensity",
      "value": "high",
      "direct_transition": "Set_OnStatinPreop"
    },

    "Preop_Statin_Order_LowModIntensity": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "statin_rx",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "RxNorm", "code": "36567", "display": "simvastatin" }
      ],
      "remarks": ["Chronic statin — not ended (continues as long-term lipid therapy). Low/moderate-intensity-only ingredient (pad-ler-ldl-desc cohort 6 / statin_low_moderate_intensity_only)."],
      "direct_transition": "Set_Statin_Intensity_LowMod_Preop"
    },

    "Set_Statin_Intensity_LowMod_Preop": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "statin_intensity",
      "value": "low_moderate",
      "direct_transition": "Set_OnStatinPreop"
    },

    "Set_OnStatinPreop": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "on_statin_preop",
      "value": true,
      "direct_transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Decision"
    },

    "Preop_Ezetimibe_Decision": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "high_risk_group", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Chance_High" },
        { "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Chance_Std" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Ezetimibe_Chance_High": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.20, "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.80, "transition": "Preop_PCSK9_Decision" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Ezetimibe_Chance_Std": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.04, "transition": "Preop_Ezetimibe_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.96, "transition": "Preop_PCSK9_Decision" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_Ezetimibe_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "ezetimibe_rx",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "RxNorm", "code": "341248", "display": "ezetimibe" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Preop_PCSK9_Decision"
    },

    "Preop_PCSK9_Decision": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": ["Preop PCSK9 inhibitor use concentrated in FH patients only."],
      "conditional_transition": [
        { "condition": { "condition_type": "Attribute", "attribute": "fh", "operator": "==", "value": true }, "transition": "Preop_PCSK9_Chance_FH" },
        { "transition": "Preop_Meds_Done" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_PCSK9_Chance_FH": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.30, "transition": "Preop_PCSK9_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.70, "transition": "Preop_Meds_Done" }
      ]
    },

    "Preop_PCSK9_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "pcsk9_rx",
      "reason": "FH_Onset",
      "codes": [
        { "system": "RxNorm", "code": "1665684", "display": "evolocumab" }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Preop_Meds_Done"
    },

    "Preop_Meds_Done": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "direct_transition": "End_PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter"
    },

    "End_PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter": {
      "type": "EncounterEnd",
      "direct_transition": "Index_Treatment_Branch"
    },

    "Index_Treatment_Branch": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "50/50 open vs endovascular LER. Both are index revascularizations (all module",
        "patients are revascularized — that is the cohort inclusion). No medical-only arm."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
